<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
    <p xml:id="Aink160-kilavi">
      pulanta kātaṟparattai pulavitīrātu talaimakaṉ vāyilvēṇṭi vantāṉeṉṟatu aṟinta talaimakaḷ vāyiṉmaṟuttatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
      The heroine who learned that the hero, desiring entry, has come, the sulking of the beloved other woman not having ended.</p>
</div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink160">
<l>veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷai cetteṉak</l>
<l>kāṇiya ceṉṟa maṭanaṭai nārai</l>
<l>nontataṉ ṟalaiyu nōymikun tuṟaiva</l>
<l>paṇṭaiyiṉ mikapperi tiṉaii</l>
<l>muyaṅkumati peruma mayaṅkiṉaḷ peritē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Oh man from the ghat in which the suffering topping its pain</l>
        <l>[It being] a wader with an inexperienced gait</l>
        <l>That went to see, since the hatchling of the white wader died,</l>
        <l>Increases —</l>
        <l>Being tormented very greatly because of the past,</l>
        <l>Embrace her, oh great one! She is greatly confused.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
